# 2. FEATURE OBJECTIVE

Create a dedicated flowCTRL feature:

**Project-Building Tutorials**

Purpose:

Help developers learn by building real projects instead of only consuming theoretical tutorials.

Users should be able to:

1. Discover different project-building tutorials.
2. Search for projects by name, technology, programming language, and category.
3. Explore detailed project explanations.
4. Understand what they will build and why.
5. Follow structured, step-by-step building instructions.
6. Access relevant documentation, GitHub repositories, and external learning resources.
7. Understand the technologies and concepts involved.
8. Track their project-building progress.
9. Mark individual steps as completed.
10. Resume unfinished projects whenever they return.

The feature should make project-based learning a core part of flowCTRL.

